From ee9e2f1dfc2d203539e3ca47a8f8932750769e20 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nathan Singh <nathan.singh@hotmail.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 11:10:26 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] Arena: Djinn and Psynergy panels and paged icon purchase
 grids

The party strip picker takes a mode: the member's items, Djinn (element icon and
name, three columns of eight rows) or Psynergy (icon and name, two columns of
four), in a panel across the top. The Djinn and Psynergy shops are now grids of
icon and name, two columns by six rows, with pages on L and R and the price
and page number under them.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
